{"ref":"BDB, צֹאָה","hw":"צֹאָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. filth</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.8\">Is 28:8</a> (of drunkards’ vomit, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, קִיא\" href=\"/BDB,_קִיא\", dir=\"rtl\">קִיא</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> fig. of iniquity, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.4\">Is 4:4</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.12\">Pr 30:12</a>; specif. of human <em>excrement</em> (= [<span dir=\"rtl\">צֵאָה</span>]) sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹאָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.27\">2 K 18:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.12\">Is 36:12</a> (both Qr; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">חר(א)יהם</span>, cf. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, חֶרֶא\" href=\"/BDB,_חֶרֶא\", dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶא</a>] p. 351 supr.).","next":"BDB, צֹאִי","prev":"BDB, צֵאָה²"}